      <title>Why Indians moving to the US rush to buy homes</title>
      <link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/why-do-indians-moving-to-the-us-buy-homes-so-soon-an-indian-living-in-america-explains/articleshow/133293168.cms</link>
      <description>Indian immigrants are increasingly able to secure homes in the US soon after their arrival. With appealing mortgage conditions and reduced initial payments, owning a home becomes a realistic goal. The affordability of monthly mortgage payments, often on par with rental costs, encourages investment in real estate. Moreover, strong cultural emphasis on homeownership supports property acquisition as a financial strategy for wealth enhancement. Fuente: The Times of India - World.</description>
